---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import SiteImage from '../components/SiteImage.astro';
---
<Layout title="Outreach & Impact" description="DuneBroom's grassroots education program: environmental literacy workshops reaching 450+ students across 5 schools in India, a children's book, and news coverage.">
<main id="main-content">
      <section class="py-16 max-w-[860px] mx-auto px-4 sm:px-8">
        <p class="text-sm text-muted mb-3 mt-0">Environment awareness program</p>
        <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-medium tracking-tight leading-tight mb-4 mt-0">
          Outreach and impact
        </h1>
        <p class="text-lg text-subtle mb-8 leading-relaxed mt-0 max-w-[36rem]">
          Combining grassroots education, environmental literacy, and technological innovation
          to empower the next generation of eco-innovators.
        </p>

        <div class="flex gap-4 flex-wrap mb-16">
          <div class="bg-surface rounded-xl p-5 border border-border min-w-[160px]">
            <span class="figure text-[28px] font-medium text-foreground leading-none block mb-2">450+</span>
            <span class="text-[13px] text-muted">Students reached</span>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-surface rounded-xl p-5 border border-border min-w-[160px]">
            <span class="figure text-[28px] font-medium text-foreground leading-none block mb-2">5</span>
            <span class="text-[13px] text-muted">Partner schools</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="pb-16 mb-16 border-b border-border">
          <p class="text-sm text-muted mb-3 mt-0"><span class="figure text-accent">01</span>&ensp;Grassroots education</p>
          <h2 class="text-[28px] font-medium tracking-tight leading-tight mb-4 mt-0">Empowering youth across borders</h2>
          <p class="text-base text-muted leading-relaxed mb-6">
            Environmental protection is a global responsibility that requires global education.
            By partnering with multiple schools across India, we hosted interactive environmental
            awareness workshops to engage students directly. This education was translated into
            active participation through large-scale environmental-theme drawing competitions,
            giving hundreds of students a creative platform to express their vision for a cleaner,
            greener Earth.
          </p>

          <div class="w-full overflow-hidden rounded-xl mb-3">
            <SiteImage
              src="/in-classroom.jpg"
              alt="Students in classroom watching a virtual environmental awareness workshop"
              sizes="(max-width: 900px) 100vw, 796px"
              width={1600}
              height={716}
              class="w-full object-cover" style="width: 100%; height: auto"
            />
          </div>
          <p class="text-[13px] text-muted mb-12 mt-0">
            Virtual environmental awareness workshop — Kasturba Gandhi Balika Vidyalaya, Andhra Pradesh
          </p>

          <h3 class="text-lg font-medium mb-1 mt-0">In the news</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-muted mb-6 mt-0 leading-relaxed">
            As covered by regional press across Andhra Pradesh · March 2026
          </p>
          <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4 items-start">
            {[
              { src: "/article-1.jpg", alt: "Prajasakti newspaper coverage of DuneBroom school outreach", width: 1041, height: 1250 },
              { src: "/article-2.jpg", alt: "Andhra Prabha newspaper coverage of DuneBroom school outreach", width: 1600, height: 908 },
              { src: "/article-3.jpg", alt: "Eenadu newspaper coverage of DuneBroom school outreach", width: 1052, height: 406 },
              { src: "/article-4.jpg", alt: "Manam newspaper coverage of DuneBroom school outreach", width: 1600, height: 1032 },
            ].map((article) => (
              <div class="overflow-hidden rounded-xl border border-border bg-white">
                <SiteImage
                  src={article.src}
                  alt={article.alt}
                  sizes="(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 390px"
                  width={article.width}
                  height={article.height}
                  class="w-full object-cover" style="width: 100%; height: auto"
                />
              </div>
            ))}
          </div>
        </div>

        <div>
          <p class="text-sm text-muted mb-3 mt-0"><span class="figure text-accent">02</span>&ensp;Environmental literacy</p>
          <h2 class="text-[28px] font-medium tracking-tight leading-tight mb-4 mt-0">Educating through pages</h2>
          <p class="text-base text-muted leading-relaxed mb-6">
            Real change starts with understanding. To help kids connect with the environment,
            I wrote <strong class="font-medium text-foreground">Adventures of Sunbeam</strong> — a book that turns complex
            environmental issues into inspiring stories for young readers. It includes an appendix
            full of interactive activities and drawing pages, and now serves as the foundation for
            our educational programs everywhere.
          </p>

          <a
            href="https://www.amazon.com/Adventures-Sunbeam-heartwarming-sustainability-potential-ebook/dp/B0GKCXW4DL/"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="btn-primary mb-10"
          >
            Read Adventures of Sunbeam &rarr;
          </a>

          <div class="w-full overflow-hidden rounded-xl mb-3">
            <SiteImage
              src="/people-holding-up-book.jpg"
              alt="Students holding up copies of Adventures of Sunbeam"
              width={1600}
              height={624}
              sizes="(max-width: 900px) 100vw, 796px"
              class="w-full object-cover" style="width: 100%; height: auto"
            />
          </div>
          <p class="text-[13px] text-muted mt-0">
            Students receiving copies of Adventures of Sunbeam — Andhra Pradesh, India
          </p>
        </div>
      </section>
    </main>
</Layout>
